# Hyundai i10 five-door hatchback, 2008-2013.
#
# Hyundai's city car, designed and engineered in Europe and built in India:
# 3,565 mm long, 1,595 mm wide, 1,540 mm high, 2,380 mm wheelbase; 1.1-1.2
# petrol. A strong budget seller in Britain during the scrappage years.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyundai_i10
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Grey are documented Hyundai colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 40 in total (white 14, red 10, blue 9, grey 7).
#
# Speed 150 km/h; comfort 75/443 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 2008-2013 with a road tail to about 2023.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/hyundai-i10.blend. References:
# citycars/references/hyundai-i10/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

